{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mana crystals have been appearing all around the world. The cause: unknown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The adventurer's guild has been created to manage the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are playing as a novice adventurer who just enlisted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your task is simple. Complete guild quests to restore order and find what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The guild has entrusted you with a wand capable of unleashing powerful spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Insert basic crystals into its sockets to unlock its true potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are now ready to take on quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay alive\u2014if you fall, you\u2019ll lose both your gold and your wand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551350/extras/combat.gif?t=1746885231\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 biomes to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 different type of quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">24 mechanically and visually different spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Dynamic combat against a large variety of enemies. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to embrace the journey of <strong>The Novice</strong>? <strong>Find the source of the madness now!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3551350?t=1746885231","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551350/64d86908fbeae932260176f681a544bd4ec23785/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746885231","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35